      </div>
      <p>MST: 2803234866</p>
      <p>Địa chỉ: Thôn Hùng Tiến, Xã Xuân Bình, Tỉnh Thanh Hóa</p>
      <p>Hotline: +81 080-5050-8378</p>
      <p>Email: dichvuquocteczt@gmail.com</p>
      <div class="footer__socials">
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/tokuteicozaotrang" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Facebook"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.4 21v-8.2h2.8l.42-3.24h-3.22V7.49c0-.94.26-1.58 1.6-1.58h1.72V3.01c-.3-.04-1.32-.13-2.5-.13-2.48 0-4.18 1.51-4.18 4.29v2.39H7.24v3.24h2.8V21h3.36z"/></svg></a>
